# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Secrets — never commit any .env variant.
# `*.local` above already catches `.env.local`, but the explicit patterns
# below also block `.env`, `.env.production`, `.env.development`, etc.
# `.env.example` is *also* ignored — historically it was kept as a tracked
# placeholder template, but in practice contributors paste real keys into
# it. Gitignoring closes that footgun. Re-introduce a tracked template
# under a different name (e.g. `docs/env-template.md`) if needed.
.env
.env.*

# Claude Code local state (sessions, settings, agent telemetry)
.claude/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
